# Tests

## Environment

- Profile `test`: H2, Flyway off, `spring.cache.type=simple`, Redis autoconfig excluded.
- In-memory blacklist for tests — do not require a real Redis in unit tests.

## Style

- Prefer pure unit tests + Mockito (`@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)`).
- Use `@WebMvcTest` / `@SpringBootTest` only when the existing suite already does for that layer.
- WebMvc slice tests: `@ActiveProfiles(ProfileConstant.TEST)` (never `dev` — DEBUG flood + wrong beans) plus `@Import({SecurityConfigTest.class, GlobalExceptionHandler.class})`. `SecurityConfigTest` enables method security.
- Mirror main package path; name `*Test`.
- `@MockitoBean` / `@Mock` patterns: copy the closest existing test.

## After changing auth / JWT / blacklist / cache

```bash
./mvnw -Dtest=TokenBlacklistServiceImplTest,AuthServiceImplTest,JwtServiceImplTest,JwtBlacklistFilterTest test
```

Broader safety net: `./mvnw test` (Spotless check runs on `validate`). CI / pre-merge: `./mvnw verify` (tests + Boot jar).
